WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.752
Quick recap of the three sites.

00:00:02.449 --> 00:00:04.515
A is where new tRNAs come in.

00:00:04.724 --> 00:00:06.512
They stay if the anticodon matches.

00:00:07.209 --> 00:00:09.020
P is where the peptide bond forms.

00:00:09.844 --> 00:00:11.946
E is where empty tRNAs leave.

00:00:12.770 --> 00:00:14.036
Watch one full round.

00:00:14.651 --> 00:00:15.324
In at A.

00:00:15.429 --> 00:00:16.439
Bond at P.

00:00:16.567 --> 00:00:17.368
Out from E.

00:00:17.519 --> 00:00:20.560
Like a factory line: in, join, out.

00:00:21.257 --> 00:00:24.519
tRNAs enter at A, the peptide bond

00:00:24.565 --> 00:00:26.957
forms at P, and empty tRNAs leave

00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:27.480
from E.

00:00:28.107 --> 00:00:29.453
Let's see what you remember.
